  ('810a5c3c-0056-0464-22d9-ed918f3dbebd', 'Bard', NULL, 'Ability Score Improvement', 16, 'When you reach 4th level, and again at 8th, 12th, 16th, and 19th level, you can increase one ability score of your choice by 2, or you can increase two ability scores of your choice by 1. As normal, you can''t increase an ability score above 20 using this feature.', 'passive', NULL, NULL),
  ('0c210950-77ff-e33b-d436-0270f1e1f51a', 'Bard', NULL, 'Song of Rest (d12)', 17, 'Beginning at 2nd level, you can use soothing music or oration to help revitalize your wounded allies during a short rest. If you or any friendly creatures who can hear your performance regain hit points at the end of the short rest by spending one or more Hit Dice, each of those creatures regains an extra 1d6 hit points. 

