  ('49a1747f-6fbf-9a31-d20e-f501a82e9934', 'Bard', NULL, 'Magical Secrets', 18, 'By 10th level, you have plundered magical knowledge from a wide spectrum of disciplines. Choose two spells from any class, including this one. A spell you choose must be of a level you can cast, as shown on the Bard table, or a cantrip. 

