  ('3327da79-308e-fbab-a102-6a879832fd89', 'Druid', NULL, 'Ability Score Improvement', 8, 'When you reach 4th level, and again at 8th, 12th, 16th, and 19th level, you can increase one ability score of your choice by 2, or you can increase two ability scores of your choice by 1. As normal, you can''t increase an ability score above 20 using this feature.', 'passive', NULL, NULL),
  ('af0ae79b-d5f9-9b57-b7ad-e0f9cdbb5933', 'Druid', NULL, 'Wild Shape (CR 1 or below)', 8, 'Starting at 2nd level, you can use your action to magically assume the shape of a beast that you have seen before. You can use this feature twice. You regain expended uses when you finish a short or long rest.

